# Selecting without the axe (touch screens, gamepads, Bedrock)
command.portal.pos.usage= Usage: /portal pos1|pos2 [x y z] (use ~ for your position)
command.portal.pos.help=Sets a corner of the selection without the axe
command.portal.pos.detailedhelp=/portal pos1 and /portal pos2 set the corners of your selection to the block you are standing in, or to the given coordinates (~ means your own position, ~5 is 5 blocks away). Useful when clicking blocks with the axe is awkward, for example on Bedrock.
